ething special. All our puli names are 100% free, no sign-up required.\"}]]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 mb-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Tips for Choosing the Perfect \",\"Puli\",\" Name\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 mb-4\",\"children\":\"Naming your puli is one of the most personal and lasting decisions you will make as a pet owner. The right blue puli name becomes part of your daily vocabulary, spoken hundreds of times over years of companionship. Here are five essential tips for choosing the perfect blue name for your puli.\"}],[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3 list-decimal list-inside\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed pl-1\",\"children\":\"Say the name aloud several times before committing — blue puli names should feel natural and joyful every time you call your pet.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed pl-1\",\"children\":\"Choose a name with clear consonant sounds that your puli can easily distinguish from background noise and everyday conversation.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed pl-1\",\"children\":\"Consider your puli's personality before finalizing. The most blue name is the one that genuinely matches who your companion actually is.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed pl-1\",\"children\":\"Test your top three choices for a few days each. The name that consistently feels right during feeding, play, and cuddle time is your winner.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed pl-1\",\"children\":\"Involve your whole household in the decision. A blue puli name should resonate with everyone who will use it daily for years to come.\"}]]}]]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shado